sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor User
    participant Cron as Cron Scheduler
    participant UI as Coding UI
    participant SM as Session Manager
    participant WM as Workspace Manager
    participant Skill as Skill Manager
    participant Context as Context Builder
    participant Agent as Coding Agent
    participant Policy as Approval Policy
    participant Gateway as Model Gateway
    participant Provider as OpenAI-Compatible Provider
    participant Tools as Tool Executor
    participant Shell as Shell / Terminal
    participant WS as Workspace / Filesystem
    participant Notify as Notification Service

    Note over User,WS: 1. WORKSPACE LIFECYCLE

    alt Create Workspace
        User->>UI: User provides path(eg.D:\Apps\project1) default is current dirctory path
        UI->>WM: createWorkspace(path)
        WM->>WS: Initialize workspace
        WS-->>WM: Workspace ready
        WM-->>UI: workspace is created and current working directory is set to the workspace path
    else Switch Workspace
        User->>UI: Switch Workspace, list all workspaces
        UI->>WM: listWorkspaces()
        WM-->>UI: list of workspace paths
        User->>UI: Select workspace to switch
        UI->>WM: switch Workspace with selected workspace path
        WM->>WS: Resolve selected workspace
        WS-->>WM: Workspace ready
        WM-->>UI: workspace is switched and current working directory is set to the  selected workspace path
    end

    Note over User,WS: 2. SESSION LIFECYCLE

    alt Create Session
        User->>UI: New Session (default name is uuid)
        UI->>SM: createSession(current active workspace)
        SM->>WM: resolveWorkspace(current active workspace)
        WM-->>SM: current active workspace reference
        SM->>SM: Initialize session defaults
        Note over SM: [provider<br/>model<br/>temperature<br/>approval mode<br/>loaded skills]<br/>default values: <br/>[OpenRouter, openrouter/free, 0.0, ASK, []]
        SM-->>UI: session name
    else Rename Session
        User->>UI: Rename Session
        UI->>SM: renameSession(current session name, new name)
        SM-->>UI: Renamed
    else Delete Session
        User->>UI: Delete Session
        UI->>SM: deleteSession(current session name)
        SM-->>UI: Session deleted
    else Resume Session
        User->>UI: Resume Session, list sessions in current active workspace
        UI->>SM: listSessions(current active workspace)
        SM-->>UI: list of sessions in current active workspace
        User->>UI: Select session to resume
        UI->>SM: resume(current active workspace, selected session name)
        SM->>SM: Load persisted selected session
        Note over SM: Restore conversation<br/>model configuration<br/>approval policy<br/>workspace name<br/>loaded skills
        SM->>WM: resolveWorkspace(workspace name)
        end
        SM->>Skill: Restore loaded skills
        Skill-->>SM: Skill definitions
        SM->>Context: Rebuild LLM-visible context
        Note over Context: Include conversation<br/>agent tool results<br/>! command results<br/>loaded skill instructions
        Note over Context: Exclude !! commands<br/>and !! command outputs
        Context-->>SM: Context restored
        alt Pending Tool Approval Exists
            SM-->>UI: Restore Pending ToolRequest
            UI-->>User: Show approval request
        else No Pending Approval
            SM-->>UI: Session ready
        end
    end

    Note over User,WS: 3. MODEL CONFIGURATION

    User->>UI: Open Model Selector
    UI->>Gateway: List Providers / Models
    par Query configured providers
        Gateway->>Provider: List OpenAI models
        Provider-->>Gateway: Models
        Gateway->>Provider: List OpenRouter models
        Provider-->>Gateway: Models
        Gateway->>Provider: List Gemini models
        Provider-->>Gateway: Models
        Gateway->>Provider: List Groq models
        Provider-->>Gateway: Models
    end
    Gateway->>Gateway: Normalize Model Catalog
    Gateway-->>UI: Searchable Models
    User->>UI: Search Models
    UI->>UI: Filter Model Catalog
    User->>UI: Select Provider
    User->>UI: Select Model
    User->>UI: Set Temperature
    UI->>SM: Save ModelConfig
    Note over SM: provider<br/>base URL / credentials reference<br/>model<br/>temperature<br/>capabilities

    Note over User,WS: 4. APPROVAL MODE

    User->>UI: Select Approval Mode
    alt Read Only
        UI->>SM: approvalMode = READ_ONLY
    else Ask
        UI->>SM: approvalMode = ASK
    else Approve Everything
        UI->>SM: approvalMode = AUTO_APPROVE
    end

    Note over User,WS: 5. MANUAL SKILL MANAGEMENT

    alt Load Skill
        User->>UI: Load Skill
        UI->>Skill: load(skillId)
        Skill->>Skill: Resolve + validate skill
        Skill-->>UI: Skill definition
        UI->>SM: attachSkill(sessionId, skillId)
        SM-->>UI: Skill loaded
    else Unload Skill
        User->>UI: Unload Skill
        UI->>Skill: unload(skillId)
        UI->>SM: detachSkill(sessionId, skillId)
        SM-->>UI: Skill unloaded
    end

    Note over User,WS: 6. USER-EXECUTED SHELL COMMANDS

    alt !command - LLM CAN SEE
        User->>UI: !<command>
        UI->>WM: Resolve current workspace
        WM-->>UI: Workspace
        UI->>Shell: Execute command
        Shell->>WS: Run inside workspace
        WS-->>Shell: Runtime / Filesystem
        Shell-->>UI: stdout + stderr + exitCode
        UI-->>User: Display command result
        UI->>SM: Persist visible shell event
        SM->>Context: Add command + output
        Note over Context: Command AND result<br/>are visible to LLM
    else !!command - LLM CANNOT SEE
        User->>UI: !!<command>
        UI->>WM: Resolve current workspace
        WM-->>UI: Workspace
        UI->>Shell: Execute command
        Shell->>WS: Run inside workspace
        WS-->>Shell: Runtime / Filesystem
        Shell-->>UI: stdout + stderr + exitCode
        UI-->>User: Display command result
        UI->>SM: Persist private shell event
        Note over SM,Context: Do NOT inject command,<br/>output, or marker into LLM context
    end

    Note over User,WS: 7. USER SENDS CODING REQUEST

    User->>UI: Send Prompt
    UI->>SM: submit(sessionId, prompt)
    SM->>WM: Resolve workspace
    WM->>WS: Get current workspace state
    WS-->>WM: Workspace state
    WM-->>SM: Workspace reference
    SM->>Skill: Get Loaded Skills
    Skill-->>SM: Skill instructions + capabilities
    SM->>Context: Build Agent Context
    Note over Context: System instructions<br/>conversation history<br/>loaded skills<br/>visible ! shell events<br/>workspace context<br/>tool definitions
    Context-->>SM: LLM-visible context
    SM->>Agent: Start / Continue Agent Run

    Note over User,WS: 8. INITIAL LLM REQUEST

    Agent->>Gateway: generate(context, tools, ModelConfig)
    Gateway->>Gateway: Resolve provider adapter
    Note over Gateway: Normalize provider differences
    Gateway->>Provider: OpenAI-compatible request
    Provider-->>Gateway: Stream response / ToolRequest
    Gateway->>Gateway: Normalize response
    Gateway-->>Agent: Assistant response / ToolRequest

    Note over User,WS: 9. CODING AGENT EXECUTION LOOP

    loop Until Agent Completes or Stops
        alt LLM Returns Final Response
            Agent->>SM: Persist assistant response
            SM-->>UI: Stream response
            UI-->>User: Display response
        else LLM Requests Clarification
            Agent->>SM: requestClarification(query)
            SM-->>UI: Display Clarification Request
            UI-->>User: Show Request
            User->>UI: Provide Info
            UI->>SM: persistClarificationResponse(info)
            SM->>Context: Add Info to Context
        else LLM Requests Tool
            Agent->>Policy: Evaluate ToolRequest
            alt READ_ONLY MODE
                alt Read-only Tool
                    Policy-->>Agent: ALLOW
                    Agent->>Tools: Execute ToolRequest
                    alt Read / Search Files
                        Tools->>WS: Read / search
                        WS-->>Tools: Results
                    else Git Inspection
                        Tools->>WS: git status / diff / log
                        WS-->>Tools: Git result
                    end
                    Tools-->>Agent: ToolResult
                else Mutating / Execute Tool
                    Policy-->>Agent: BLOCK
                    Agent->>SM: Record policy denial
                    SM->>Context: Add policy denial
                end
            else AUTO_APPROVE MODE
                Policy-->>Agent: AUTO APPROVED
                Agent->>Tools: Execute ToolRequest
                alt File Read
                    Tools->>WS: Read / search
                    WS-->>Tools: Result
                else File Modification
                    Tools->>WS: Create / edit / patch / delete
                    WS-->>Tools: Result
                else Git Operation
                    Tools->>WS: Execute Git operation
                    WS-->>Tools: Result
                else Shell Command
                    Tools->>Shell: Execute command
                    Shell->>WS: Run in workspace
                    WS-->>Shell: Runtime environment
                    Shell-->>Tools: stdout + stderr + exitCode
                end
                Tools-->>Agent: ToolResult
            else ASK MODE
                Policy-->>Agent: USER APPROVAL REQUIRED
                Agent->>SM: Persist Pending ToolRequest
                Note over SM: Session status =<br/>WAITING_FOR_APPROVAL
                SM-->>UI: Approval Request
                UI-->>User: Tool + Arguments + Reason
                alt User Approves
                    User->>UI: Approve
                    UI->>SM: approve(toolRequestId)
                    SM->>Agent: Tool Approved
                    Agent->>Tools: Execute ToolRequest
                    alt Workspace Operation
                        Tools->>WS: Perform operation
                        WS-->>Tools: Result
                    else Shell Operation
                        Tools->>Shell: Execute command
                        Shell->>WS: Run in workspace
                        WS-->>Shell: Environment
                        Shell-->>Tools: stdout + stderr + exitCode
                    end
                    Tools-->>Agent: ToolResult
                    SM->>SM: Clear Pending ToolRequest
                else User Denies
                    User->>UI: Deny
                    UI->>SM: deny(toolRequestId)
                    SM->>Agent: Tool Denied
                    Agent->>Agent: Record denial
                    SM->>SM: Clear Pending ToolRequest
                else User Denies With Feedback
                    User->>UI: Deny + Feedback
                    UI->>SM: deny(toolRequestId, feedback)
                    SM->>Agent: Tool Denied + User Feedback
                    Agent->>Agent: Record denial + feedback
                    SM->>SM: Clear Pending ToolRequest
                end
            end
            Note over Agent,Provider: Continue reasoning after tool result,<br/>policy block, denial, or feedback
            Agent->>Context: Append Result / Decision
            Context-->>Agent: Updated context
            Agent->>Gateway: Continue Agent Turn
            Gateway->>Provider: OpenAI-compatible request
            Provider-->>Gateway: Response / Next ToolRequest
            Gateway-->>Agent: Normalized response
        end
    end

    Note over User,WS: 10. RUN COMPLETION

    Agent->>WS: Get final workspace state
    WS-->>Agent: Modified files + Git status
    Agent->>SM: Persist Run
    Note over SM: Store run snapshot:<br/>provider + model<br/>temperature<br/>approval mode<br/>skills<br/>tool calls<br/>approvals / denials<br/>response
    SM->>SM: Update lastActiveAt
    SM-->>UI: Run completed
    UI-->>User: Response + changed files

    Note over User,WS: 11. LEAVE AND RESUME LATER

    User->>UI: Close / Leave Session
    UI->>SM: Persist Session State
    alt Agent Idle
        SM->>SM: status = IDLE
    else Waiting For Approval
        SM->>SM: status = WAITING_FOR_APPROVAL
        Note over SM: Pending ToolRequest preserved
    end
    Note over SM: Session can later be resumed<br/>with workspace, skills, model settings,<br/>conversation and approval state intact

    Note over User,WS: 12. CRON JOB LIFECYCLE (SCHEDULED RUNS)

    alt Create Cron Job
        User->>UI: New Cron Job
        UI->>SM: createCronJob(workspaceId, schedule, promptTemplate, modelConfig, approvalMode, skills)
        SM->>SM: Validate cron expression
        SM->>SM: Store CronJob definition
        Note over SM: workspaceId<br/>cron expression, e.g. every 30 minutes<br/>prompt template<br/>model config<br/>approval mode<br/>loaded skills<br/>enabled = true<br/>nextRunAt
        SM-->>UI: cronJobId
    else Edit Cron Job
        User->>UI: Edit Cron Job
        UI->>SM: updateCronJob(cronJobId, changes)
        SM->>SM: Recompute nextRunAt
        SM-->>UI: Cron job updated
    else Pause Cron Job
        User->>UI: Pause Cron Job
        UI->>SM: setCronJobEnabled(cronJobId, false)
        SM-->>UI: Cron job paused
    else Resume Cron Job
        User->>UI: Resume Cron Job
        UI->>SM: setCronJobEnabled(cronJobId, true)
        SM->>SM: Recompute nextRunAt
        SM-->>UI: Cron job resumed
    else Delete Cron Job
        User->>UI: Delete Cron Job
        UI->>SM: deleteCronJob(cronJobId)
        Note over SM: Past run history retained<br/>Workspace is NOT deleted
        SM-->>UI: Cron job deleted
    else View Run History
        User->>UI: Open Cron Job History
        UI->>SM: getCronJobRuns(cronJobId)
        SM-->>UI: Past runs (status, duration, diff summary)
        UI-->>User: Display run history
    end

    Note over User,WS: 13. CRON JOB TRIGGERED EXECUTION (UNATTENDED)

    loop Scheduler Tick
        Cron->>Cron: Evaluate enabled cron expressions
        Cron->>SM: getDueCronJobs(now)
        SM-->>Cron: Due CronJob list

        loop For each due CronJob
            Cron->>SM: createSessionFromCronJob(cronJobId)
            SM->>WM: resolveWorkspace(workspaceId)
            alt Workspace busy with active user session
                WM-->>SM: Workspace locked
                SM->>Notify: notifyRunSkipped(cronJobId, reason)
                Notify-->>User: Notification (run skipped)
            else Workspace missing
                WM-->>SM: Workspace unavailable
                SM->>Notify: notifyRunFailed(cronJobId, workspace unavailable)
                Notify-->>User: Notification (failure)
            else Workspace available
                WM->>WS: Attach workspace
                WS-->>WM: Workspace state
                WM-->>SM: Workspace attached
                SM->>Skill: Restore configured skills
                Skill-->>SM: Skill definitions
                SM->>Context: Build Agent Context
                Note over Context: System instructions<br/>cron prompt template<br/>loaded skills<br/>workspace context<br/>tool definitions
                Context-->>SM: LLM-visible context
                SM->>Agent: Start Unattended Agent Run
                Note over SM: Session status = RUNNING (unattended)<br/>source = CRON, cronJobId

                Agent->>Gateway: generate(context, tools, ModelConfig)
                Gateway->>Provider: OpenAI-compatible request
                Provider-->>Gateway: Response / ToolRequest
                Gateway-->>Agent: Normalized response

                loop Until Agent Completes or Stops
                    alt LLM Returns Final Response
                        Agent->>SM: Persist assistant response
                    else LLM Requests Tool
                        Agent->>Policy: Evaluate ToolRequest
                        alt Cron Approval Mode: READ_ONLY or AUTO_APPROVE
                            Policy-->>Agent: ALLOW / AUTO APPROVED
                            Agent->>Tools: Execute ToolRequest
                            alt Shell Command
                                Tools->>Shell: Execute command
                                Shell->>WS: Run in workspace
                                WS-->>Shell: stdout + stderr + exitCode
                                Shell-->>Tools: Result
                            else Workspace Operation
                                Tools->>WS: Perform operation
                                WS-->>Tools: Result
                            end
                            Tools-->>Agent: ToolResult
                            Agent->>Context: Append Result / Decision
                            Context-->>Agent: Updated context
                            Agent->>Gateway: Continue Agent Turn
                            Gateway->>Provider: OpenAI-compatible request
                            Provider-->>Gateway: Response / Next ToolRequest
                            Gateway-->>Agent: Normalized response
                        else Cron Approval Mode: ASK
                            Policy-->>Agent: USER APPROVAL REQUIRED
                            Agent->>SM: Persist Pending ToolRequest
                            Note over SM: No live user present<br/>Session status = WAITING_FOR_APPROVAL
                            SM->>SM: Queue approval for later review
                            break Awaiting approval - unattended run pauses here
                                Note over Agent: Run paused mid-turn<br/>resumes only when user reviews on return
                            end
                        end
                    end
                end

                Agent->>WS: Get final workspace state
                WS-->>Agent: Modified files + Git status
                Agent->>SM: Persist Run
                Note over SM: Store run snapshot tagged<br/>source = CRON, cronJobId<br/>provider + model + tool calls
                SM->>SM: Update lastActiveAt, lastRunAt, nextRunAt
                alt Run Completed Successfully
                    SM->>Notify: notifyRunCompleted(cronJobId, summary)
                    Notify-->>User: Notification (in-app / push)
                else Run Suspended Awaiting Approval
                    SM->>Notify: notifyApprovalNeeded(cronJobId)
                    Notify-->>User: Notification (attention needed)
                else Run Failed
                    SM->>Notify: notifyRunFailed(cronJobId, error)
                    Notify-->>User: Notification (failure)
                end
            end
        end
    end